{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-04-14 07:45:00', 'title': 'JACOBS SELECTED TO DESIGN CHANGI NEWATER FACTORY 3', 'text': "FIRM TO TEAM WITH ROTEC TO DEPLOY FR-RO TECHNOLOGY DALLAS , APRIL 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JACOBS (NYSE:J) WAS SELECTED\xa0BY PUB, SINGAPORE'S NATIONAL WATER AGENCY, TO DESIGN AND SUPERVISE CONSTRUCTION AND COMMISSIONING OF THE CHANGI NEWATER FACTORY 3 (CNF3), THE THIRD NEWATER PLANT TO BE LOCATED AT THE CHANGI WATER RECLAMATION PLANT (WRP) AND\xa0ONE OF THE WORLD'S LARGEST AND MOST ADVANCED WATER RECLAMATION PLANTS. CNF3 WILL BE ONE OF THE FIRST RECLAMATION PLANTS GLOBALLY TO USE MEMBRANE BIOREACTOR (MBR) FILTRATE TO FEED REVERSE OSMOSIS (RO) MEMBRANES."}